# Temporal Architecture Puzzle: Piece Together History (042)
# Description: The player must reconstruct optimal city layouts by placing historical structures (from ancient times to speculative futures) on a grid. The challenge lies in managing temporal constraints: cultural compatibility, resource flow, energy grids, and archaeological integrity across different time periods.
# Execution Method: python3 src/042_temporal_architecture.py
# Functionality: Spatio-Temporal Reasoning (STR), Resource Optimization, Archaeological Integrity, Constraint Satisfaction (퍼즐). (역사학적 상상력과 공학적 계산이 필요하다냥!)
# Difficulty: 상. 단순히 배치하는 것을 넘어, 각 시대의 제약조건(예: 고대 로마의 상수도와 미래의 자기부상열차 노선이 만나는 지점)을 충돌 없이 최적화하는 고차원적 시스템 사고가 필요하다냥. 🕰️🏗️
# Development Notes: A visual representation of time slices overlapping spatially would enhance the complexity and narrative feel. Nodes could represent temporal anomalies.